		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A shadowy spirit seething with anger and malice. Its presence is unsettling to animals.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 22, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 death touch +3 (1d10 + life drain), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Life Drain</strong>. 1d4 CON damage. Death if reduced to 0 CON. Slain mortals become spectres after 1 day.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
